{
"file": 25,
"paths": [
"d002/f629"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "5622a60f",
"en_raw": "Rasen-sama, Rasen-sama"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "8267ba9d",
"en_raw": "Please come in from the sunset-side window"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "660e5d0d",
"en_raw": "...Shiina, is this okay?"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "60d079f8",
"en_raw": "Wow, Nao"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "d353a9a9",
"en_raw": "you've already memorized it"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "f65d3632",
"en_raw": "Tch, you two"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "0976aedf",
"en_raw": "are like elementary schoolers"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "e3760577",
"en_raw": "Ah! Sango-chan"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "d5d33505",
"en_raw": "No!!"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "dd071d69",
"en_raw": "You see, Rasen-sama"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "da45ddd4",
"en_raw": "won't work unless you believe"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "d85879e9",
"en_raw": "It has nothing to do with me"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "f7a28a51",
"en_raw": "School ghost, my foot, idiots"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "c3db8181",
"en_raw": "No, Sango-chan too"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "9d11a595",
"en_raw": "if you don't believe"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "8a8b3b5c",
"en_raw": "Kurumi's wish"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "d91c1193",
"en_raw": "will fail too..."
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "6ac5c080",
"en_raw": "Come on, Sango"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "2e823581",
"en_raw": "believe for once"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "a625ed9d",
"en_raw": "I don't know"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "8d17735b",
"en_raw": "Then you two can just go, right?"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "06b609cd",
"en_raw": "She says so, Shiina"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "0de2fada",
"en_raw": "Then Kurumi and Nao"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "34c66141",
"en_raw": "will go to school"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "6a6fb614",
"en_raw": "Hey hey, let's hurry to school"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "b3016cf7",
"en_raw": "Tch, what the heck"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "21d819d8",
"en_raw": "Sango doesn't have to force herself"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "fbf395cc",
"en_raw": "to come along"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "4e455c48",
"en_raw": "Shut up"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "a82193b5",
"en_raw": "I wonder if Kurumi's wish will come true"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "f95510f7",
"en_raw": "Yeah, who knows"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "3670b7d0",
"en_raw": "Ah, Nao, you can't"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "50190b8d",
"en_raw": "doubt it"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "d2824250",
"en_raw": "Right, sorry, sorry"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "1ad5477a",
"en_raw": "Then, Shiina"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "193b3e0c",
"en_raw": "shall we go to school again?"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "6823bdd2",
"en_raw": "Have you heard the theory"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "b0887d9b",
"en_raw": "that NM and KS are an item?"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "9581ea56",
"en_raw": "What's that?"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "2770d503",
"en_raw": "Who knows, aren't they initials?"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "046dde8f",
"en_raw": "Nao, do you know?"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "afbf93d9",
"en_raw": "No, I don't"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "bd43198b",
"en_raw": "Come to think of it, the other day I"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "e22033bc",
"en_raw": "waited alone for quite a while"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "5a1c8e4c",
"en_raw": "Huh, really?"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "90900416",
"en_raw": "We looked for you, Sango"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "c1593828",
"en_raw": "but you didn't seem to be there"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "b997e013",
"en_raw": "When I stopped at the bathroom"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "d80d43e0",
"en_raw": "I ran into Segawa"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "189d900b",
"en_raw": "and we three strolled the Tama home"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "00d372db",
"en_raw": "Oh, so the ones at the Tama"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "4946cb64",
"en_raw": "were Nao and the others after all"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "ebd99695",
"en_raw": "What, you were there too, Sango?"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "4c87ee70",
"en_raw": "You should have called out"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "9907bd52",
"en_raw": "I didn't notice at all"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "4605b4d3",
"en_raw": "Hmm, so that's how it was"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "6196f400",
"en_raw": "So in the classroom, just the two of you"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "c696a8b3",
"en_raw": "what did you wish to Rasen-sama?"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "5c277137",
"en_raw": "...Hey, Mr. NM?"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "8f969302",
"en_raw": "Solved the rumor of Rasen-sama"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "bec53995",
"en_raw": "...In the end, what I learned"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "0d1dd4cd",
"en_raw": "is that this Rasen-sama thing"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "60ff7083",
"en_raw": "was meant to frame Shiina and me"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "a8bd0a61",
"en_raw": "a cunning trap by the Toilet Gang"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "fd689125",
"en_raw": "is what it was"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "2ffda242",
"en_raw": "...What 'isosceles triangle'"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "9726ebd7",
"en_raw": "Damn them, I will never"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "d28d0224",
"en_raw": "forgive them!"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "14f5784c",
"en_raw": "Enough, drop it"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "da16b673",
"en_raw": "Let's talk about something else already!"
}
]
}